Package: gnumeric
Version: @DEB_GNUMERIC_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnumeric
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libgoffice-0.10-10, libgsf-1-114, libxml2, libpango-1.0-0, libcairo2, libz-ng2
Description: Gnumeric spreadsheet for Xios
 Gnumeric is the GNOME spreadsheet application. This rootless iOS build ships
 the GTK3 UI, libspreadsheet, GSettings schemas, desktop/icon data, and a small
 set of common file-format and formula plugins for the Xios desktop.
